{"slug":"research/language-models-mostly-know-what-they-know","title":"Language models (mostly) know what they know \\ Anthropic","desc":"Larger models are well calibrated at judging whether their own answers are true, and can predict whether they know an answer before answering.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Language models (mostly) know what they know</h1><div class=\"yAH-gG_Actions\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.05221\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-medium\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read Paper</a></div></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2022-07-11\">Jul 11, 2022</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Team</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/alignment\">Alignment</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=hallucination\">Hallucination</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=alignment\">Alignment</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=scaling-laws\">Scaling laws</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=measurement-and-mitigation\">Measurement and mitigation</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"Ea